lib/icalBuddy
-------------

The file lib/icalBuddy is a compiled binary of icalBuddy 1.10.1, built from
the source of the icalBuddy64 fork (https://github.com/dkaluta/icalBuddy64,
tag v1.10.1) of the original icalBuddy by Ali Rantakari
(http://hasseg.org/icalBuddy), without changes to the source code. It is
distributed under the following license and is not covered by the license
above.

